== evidence 1: capacity plan approved on 2026-06-02 (excerpt)
  expected launch traffic: 1,900 req/s (pilot average, scaled to all users)
  node capacity: 4 workers / 4 ms per request = 1,000 req/s
  target CPU utilisation 70 % -> 1,900 / 700 = 2.7 -> 3 nodes; deploy 4 for safety
  SLO: p99 latency at the gateway <= 25 ms

